<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td style="font-size:11px">2.5 L = ？cm3（單位換算複習）</td><td style="font-weight:900;color:var(--gold);padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px">問老師</td></tr>
</table>
<div style="font-size:9px;color:var(--gray-400);text-align:center;margin-top:4px">⚠️ 請先自己完成練習，再查答案！🟢=自動計算 🟡=請向老師確認</div>
</div>
<!-- ===== HQ TRAP QUESTIONS ===== -->
<section class="hq-trap-section">
<div class="lf-h1">T 陷阱診斷專區 — 高品質陷阱題</div>
<p>霖楓教研團隊精心設計，每題針對一個常見考試陷阱。4題。</p>
<div class="lf-trap-section">
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T5-P6-0101">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T5 體積</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T5-P6-0101</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">長方體長2m、闊50cm、高30cm，體積=？m³</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>0.3m³</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「體積三維要統一單位」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T5-P6-0102">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T5 體積</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T5-P6-0102</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">1立方米 = ？立方厘米</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>1,000,000cm³</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「1m³=一百萬cm³」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T5-P6-0103">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T5 體積</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T5-P6-0103</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">一個容器體積=500cm³，可裝水=？mL</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>500mL</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「1cm³=1mL，1m³=1000L」</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-trap-card" data-hq-id="LF-T5-P6-0203">
<div class="lf-trap-header">
<span class="lf-trap-badge">T5 比例</span>
<span class="lf-trap-id">LF-T5-P6-0203</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-trap-q">TSA題型：地圖上1cm代表實際500m。地圖上3.5cm代表實際幾多米？</div>
<div class="lf-trap-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--red);">想想看！為什麼這是陷阱？寫出正確答案：</p></div>
<div class="trap-correct"><span class="lf-ex-label">正確答案：</span>1750m</div>
<div class="trap-mantra"><span class="lf-ex-label">口訣：</span>「地圖長度×比例尺=實際距離」</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
